sentences.text:
This petition has been filed under Section 482 of the Code of Criminal Procedure invoking the inherent power of this Court, seeking quashment of charge sheet as well as FIR registered against the petitioner bearing Crime No. 304/2023 registered at Police Station, Gadwa District Singrauli,
for the offence punishable under Sections 363, 366, 343, 376(2)
(n),420 of IPC and Section 5/6 of POCSO Act along with the further proceedings initiated in pursuant thereto and all the subsequent proceedings arising out of the said crime.
